bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:11pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;・業務用油脂製品における「SUSTEC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;&lt;sub&gt;®&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;」製品の構成比向上&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:11pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;・「低負荷」価値実現のための環境基準の社内浸透&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:11pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;・上記環境基準のチェック運用実施確認、対象範囲を拡充&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
